"Paracraft帕拉卡是一款免费的动画和游戏创作工具。Paracraft使用NPL语言开发，适合"
"任意年龄用户。我们探索了基于方块的动画创作，和一种基于动画和记忆的编程模式。"
"NPL语言全称Neural Parallel Language是我们自主研发的开源编程语言，Paracraft是"
"它的编辑工具，我们用它编写了魔法哈奇，帕拉卡，KeepWork，NPL CAD等众多大型3D客"
"户端和服务器端应用软件，并开源了100多万行NPL代码。"
msgstr ""
"Paracraft is a free animation and game authoring tool. Paracraft is "
"developed using the NPL language for users of any age. We explored block-"
"based animation creation, and a programming pattern based on animation and "
"memory. NPL or Neural Parallel language is our self-developed open source "
"programming language, Paracraft is its editing tool, we use it to write "
"magic haqi, paracraft, keepwork, NPL CAD and many 3D client and server-side "
"applications, and open sourced more than 1 million lines of NPL code."

#: temp/poedit/test_paracraft_temp_poedit_strings.lua:2470
msgid "Paracraft作品市集"
msgstr "Paracraft App Store"

#: temp/poedit/test_paracraft_temp_poedit_strings.lua:2471
msgid ""
"在创意大厅中，每个人有自己的虚拟形象，可以多人联网一起玩大家制作的优质游戏，"
"或发布你自己的作品。"
msgstr ""
"In the Creative Hall, everyone has their own avatar, plays games made by "
"other users in multi-player mode, and releases your own work."

#: temp/poedit/test_paracraft_temp_poedit_strings.lua:2473
msgid "结交朋友，分享作品"
msgstr "Make friends, share works"

#: temp/poedit/test_paracraft_temp_poedit_strings.lua:2474
msgid ""
"魔法哈奇是使用Paracraft和NPL语言开发的3D儿童社区。它包含了3D卡牌战斗和众多社"
"区玩法，同时内置了Paracraft创作工具。 用户可以在这里结交新朋友，一起玩游戏，"
"分享自己的作品。"
msgstr ""
"Haqi is a 3D child community developed using the Paracraft and NPL language. "
"It includes 3D card battles, social gameplays, as well as built-in Paracraft "
"authoring tools. Users can make new friends, play games and share their work."

#: temp/poedit/test_paracraft_temp_poedit_strings.lua:2475
msgid "魔法哈奇2"
msgstr "Haqi2"

#: temp/poedit/test_paracraft_temp_poedit_strings.lua:2476
msgid ""
"魔法哈奇2是使用Paracraft和NPL语言开发的3D青年社区。它是魔法哈奇在2012-2014年"
"发布的资料篇，内置了Paracraft创作工具。"
msgstr ""
"Haqi2 is a 3D youth community developed using the Paracraft and NPL "
"language. It is a sequel to Haqi published in 2012-2014 with the built-in "
"Paracraft authoring tool."

#: temp/poedit/test_paracraft_temp_poedit_strings.lua:2477
msgid "获奖用户作品"
msgstr "Recommended user works"

#: temp/poedit/test_paracraft_temp_poedit_strings.lua:2478
msgid "作品是最好的老师"
msgstr "User work is the best teacher"

#: temp/poedit/test_paracraft_temp_poedit_strings.lua:2479
msgid ""
"Paracraft帕拉卡获奖用户作品。分享你的作品，和同伴一起学习。作品可直接提交参加"
"NPL大赛和国际智能创意大赛。"
msgstr ""
"Paracraft user works. Share your work and learn with your peers. Works can "
"be submitted directly to the online game and animation contest."

#: temp/poedit/test_paracraft_temp_poedit_strings.lua:2480
msgid "Paracraft动画与编程教学视频"
msgstr "Animation and Programming Tutorial Videos for Paracraft"

#: temp/poedit/test_paracraft_temp_poedit_strings.lua:2481
msgid "学会编程, 学会自学"
msgstr "World of Coders and Self-learners!"

#: temp/poedit/test_paracraft_temp_poedit_strings.lua:2482
msgid ""
"Paracraft是一个有15年历史的经历了大量工业实践检验的工业级别的软件生态系统。"
"Paracraft作为编程学习的生态系统，从底层的科学理论到顶层的应用实践（游戏，动"
"画，CAD 3D制图）有着完整的链条和良好的分层。从适合7-10岁的儿童积木式编程和动"
"画及游戏制作，到更进阶的NPL CAD学习，到最底层的NPL人工智能语言和C语言，您将拥"
"有一个全生态的由浅入深的编程学习系统。"
msgstr ""
"Paracraft is a 15-year-old industrial-grade software ecosystem that has "
"undergone a lot of industrial practice testing. Paracraft as a programming "
"learning ecosystem, from the bottom of the scientific theory to the top "
"level of application practices (games, animations, CAD 3D cartography) has a "
"complete chain and good layering. from the 7-10-year-old block-based "
"animation and game making to the more advanced NPL CAD learning, to the "
"underlying NPL AI language and C language, you will have an all-in-one "
"programming learning system that is completely eco-friendly."

